+' a solve must be near convergence by the ordinary limit: ceiling = limit x
+' ADAPT_ACCURACY_ESTIMATE_FACTOR (rc3 default 1.2; rc1/rc2 used 1+grace = 1.5,
+' which let P10A run a 1109-element round that cannot finish).
 Public Function RPX_HsdOrdinaryLimit(ByVal elements As Long) As Double
